Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. An elderly human man in his 70s, thin and wiry. Messy grey beard, bright intelligent eyes behind round spectacles. Wearing a faded scholar's robe with ink stains and candle wax spots. Surrounded by books and scrolls. An orange cat sits on his shoulder. Eccentric academic vibe, not a combat mage. Warm, slightly absent-minded expression. Background: cluttered study with bookshelves, jars of strange ingredients, and a crooked tower window. Style: realistic fantasy portrait, warm candlelight, waist-up.
